  "details": "# Issue:\n\nNormally when moving an Audio Slider (e.g. Worlds) it will unmute the audio channel if it was muted before.\n\nThis is however not the case in the current Open Beta, there moving an Audio Slider will not unmute the Audio Channel.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**  \n\n1. Launch VRChat  \n\n2. Go to a World with World Audio  \n\n3. Mute World Audio  \n\n4. Adjust World Audio Volume  \n\nIf you do this you will notice that the World Audio will stay muted.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nAdjusting the Volume of a muted Audio Channel should always unmute said Audio Channel. This is also how it currently behaves in live.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a Video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/w1ygmu.mp4",
